{
"dur": 75.484,
"shots": [
{
"i": 1,
"start": 0.0,
"vo_start": 0.6,
"vo_end": 8.235,
"text": "Autumn 2025. According to the Times, Trump is told about the surveillance of Alice Huang, and he takes no action.",
"end": 8.51
},
{
"i": 2,
"start": 8.51,
"vo_start": 8.785,
"vo_end": 21.89,
"text": "That winter the stronger chip Jensen has been asking for, the H200, is cleared for China. Washington takes twenty-five percent. According to the Times, it's the kind of decision the ministry hoped she could help with. Nobody has said she did.",
"end": 22.165
},
{
"i": 3,
"start": 22.165,
"vo_start": 22.44,
"vo_end": 34.868,
"text": "In the spring, a classified memo goes round at the top of the government. According to the Times, it's overseen by Secretary of State Marco Rubio, one of Washington's loudest China hawks, and it's built on the surveillance of Alice Huang.",
"end": 35.143
},
{
"i": 4,
"start": 35.143,
"vo_start": 35.418,
"vo_end": 49.444,
"text": "It goes round just before Trump flies to Beijing to meet Xi Jinping, taking America's top tech executives with him. Jensen is left off the list. Then he's put back on. Whether the memo had anything to do with either isn't known.",
"end": 49.719
},
{
"i": 5,
"start": 49.719,
"vo_start": 49.994,
"vo_end": 61.901,
"text": "That year Trump also puts him on his council of science and technology advisers. In September he's a guest at the White House state dinner for Xi. In October, Trump awards him the National Medal of Science.",
"end": 62.176
},
{
"i": 6,
"start": 62.176,
"vo_start": 62.451,
"vo_end": 74.535,
"text": "And nobody warns him. Swalwell got a defensive briefing. According to reports, Jensen Huang never gets one. US officials believed he probably didn't know who she was. Jensen says nobody in the government ever told him.",
"end": 75.485
}
],
